What is the percentage growth in exports of Country A from 2021 to 2022?', 'Country A''s exports rose from `200` to `250`, an increase of `50`.

Percentage growth = `(50/200) × 100 = **25%**`.', '2026-11-14T06:17:56.365Z');
INSERT INTO questions (id, set_id, topic_label, topic_order, sort_order, q, a, created_at) VALUES ('mba-q00229', 'mba-entrance-bank', 'Data Interpretation', 3, 12, 'The following bar graph data shows the exports (in $ million) of five countries in 2021 and 2022:
