Which country experienced a decline in exports from 2021 to 2022, and by what percentage?', 'Comparing each country''s 2021 and 2022 figures, only **Country C** shows a decline, falling from `300` to `270`.

The decline is `30`, which is `(30/300) × 100 = **10%**` of its 2021 exports.', '2026-11-14T06:17:56.365Z');
INSERT INTO questions (id, set_id, topic_label, topic_order, sort_order, q, a, created_at) VALUES ('mba-q00230', 'mba-entrance-bank', 'Data Interpretation', 3, 13, 'The following bar graph data shows the exports (in $ million) of five countries in 2021 and 2022:
