S: Principal=Rs. 8 lakh, Rate=12% p.a., Time=2 years
T: Principal=Rs. 12 lakh, Rate=9% p.a., Time=3 years

What is the simple interest earned on Bank Q''s loan?', 'Using `SI = (P × R × T)/100`: for Bank Q, `SI = (15 × 6 × 3)/100 = 270/100`.

The simple interest earned is **Rs. 2.7 lakh**.', '2026-11-14T06:17:56.365Z');
INSERT INTO questions (id, set_id, topic_label, topic_order, sort_order, q, a, created_at) VALUES ('mba-q00262', 'mba-entrance-bank', 'Data Interpretation', 3, 45, 'Five banks lend the following amounts at simple interest:
